  <XDFPATCH uniqueid="0x2605">
    <title>2048kg/h MAF Patch</title>
    <description>Extend the airflow capability of the ECU to 2048kg/h. &#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Important: As the patch alters the resolution of the mass airflow sensor scale you need to adjust the id_maf_tab table to alter and display the correct mass airflow sensor scale. Using any other xdf to view the maf sensor scale will display incorrect data.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;1. Divide the MAF definition table by 2, if using the stock one.&#013;&#010;2. Use the 2048kg/h table in order to paste new sensor data &#013;&#010;3. Increase the ADX maximum value to &quot;2048kg/h&quot;.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="21" />
    <XDFPATCHENTRY name="Location 2" address="0x3A277" datasize="0x1" patchdata="04" basedata="14" />
    <XDFPATCHENTRY name="Location 1" address="0x3A251" datasize="0x1" patchdata="04" basedata="14" />
  </XDFPATCH>
